  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Earth Trenches are places where the ground is split open into giant ravines, some stretching for millions of li and some tens of thousand of kilometers deep. An Zu Earth Trench is the Central Continent trench of that kind controlled by Demon Expelling Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Demon Expelling Sect is a super force with three Gu Immortals, and its influence covers dozens of large forces, hundreds of middle sized forces, and many smaller ones. The sect’s headquarters qualifies as a test site for the eighth round of Central Continent’s Refinement Path Convention, with outdoor squares prepared so a real-time broadcast of the contests can play in the air.",
      "chapters": [
        838
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_refinement_path_convention"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the five regions, Earth Trenches are giant ravines that only super forces usually hold as resource points. In Central Continent, Demon Expelling Sect controls the trench known as An Zu Earth Trench, and the place is famous in that region.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
